# cloak/halfcape_front: the half-cape's drape over the LEFT shoulder (FORGE-MANTLE, round 2; contracts 3c): facing down
# the cloth falls over the left shoulder and upper arm, from a brooch at the throat, its front edge one diagonal
# fold; facing left it wraps the near shoulder (a large pauldron keeps its profile: the drape falls from behind it);
# facing right and up the far side shows nothing (the back part covers it). Rigid, under the head (head z -5); a pauldron
# draws over it (D41). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role cloak halfcape
layer head
anchor neck
keys cloakfront
z -5
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

view U key rest origin 0 0 layer head
|.

view D key rest origin -1 3 layer head
|.QQQQ.....
|QPOSSQQ...
|QRSSSSSQQ.
|.QRSSTSSSQ
|..QRSTSRSQ
|...QRTSRSQ
|....QRSRTQ
|.....QRRTQ
|......QRRQ
|.......QQQ

view R key rest origin 0 0
|.

view L key rest origin 4 3
|.QQQQQ...
|QPOSSSQQ.
|QSSSSSSSQ
|.QSSSSRSQ
|.QSSTSRSQ
|..QSTSRSQ
|..QRTSRSQ
|...QRSRSQ
|....QRRRQ
|.....QQQQ
